# NEVER commit wireguard private keys. The build context bakes them
# into the image — if the image is public-pulled (or the brand-repo is
# fork-leaked), VPN identity is compromised.
#
# Generate keys at deploy time via keys-init.sh, or supply per-brand
# from .secrets/<env>/wireguard/. Public keys may be committed but
# we keep the rule simple: ignore both.

server/privatekey
server/publickey
peers/*/privatekey
peers/*/publickey
